# Regex patterns for links lychee should not check.
# Keep this list minimal so that a genuine breakage still turns the build red.

# MkDocs directory-style URLs. The episode cards in docs/index.md link to
# "episodes/<slug>/", which exists only once the site is built. These internal
# links are validated properly by `mkdocs build --strict` in the deploy workflow.
file://.*/docs/episodes/[0-9]

# Hosts that answer CI runners with 403 rather than serving the page.
# Each was verified by hand and is reachable from a browser.
^https://medium\.com/
^https://deviparikh\.medium\.com/
^https://eprint\.iacr\.org/
^https://emergency\.cdc\.gov/
